    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0310_botan_02",
      "hash64": "269F2BF8054588FF",
      "text": "It’s about Operation Starfall. Remember what\\nI told you before?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0310_botan_03",
      "hash64": "269F2AF80545874C",
      "text": "Team Star is made up of five individual squads.\\nAnd each one’s got their own base.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0310_botan_04",
      "hash64": "269F29F805458599",
      "text": "I need you to go to each base—all five of ’em—\\nand beat the squad boss there.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0310_botan_05",
      "hash64": "269F28F8054583E6",
      "text": "Team Star’s grunts might try to get in your way,\\nbut I’ll be helping you out...from a distance.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0310_botan_06",
      "hash64": "269F27F805458233",
      "text": "And heads-up that the bosses each specialize in\\na different Pokémon type. Just remember the\\r\\nnames of their crews, and you’ll figure it out.\\c\\nStill, no need to worry. With your skills, I’m sure\\nyou’re more than up to the task.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
